hol-induced neuropathy: subacute time course and constitutional features suggest more urgent evaluation"], "alarm_features": ["Unintentional weight loss", "Long-term heavy tobacco use", "Diabetes mellitus", "Chronic alcohol consumption"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Brachial Plexopathy", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.39560439560439564, "posterior": 0.22987457240592937, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.5, "evidence_for": ["Subacute time course moderately reduces likelihood of acute cerebral infarction."], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B1.1", "B1.2", "B1.3"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.7, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "anatomy", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Thoracic Outlet Syndrome / Apical Mass", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.29670329670329654, "posterior": 0.18841505131128844, "danger": 0.6, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.5, "evidence_for": ["Bodybuilder status and subacute onset moderately support a soft tissue compression mechanism in thoracic outlet syndrome."], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B2.1", "B2.2"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.5, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "anatomy", "representative_diseases": []}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Cerebrovascular Event", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.016, "danger": 0.9, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Subacute progression moderately reduces likelihood of cerebral infarction."]}, "B4": {"id": "B4", "label": "Malignancy with Paraneoplastic Features", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.0, "